{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity</strong> is a physics-based puzzle game where the laws of attraction are no longer constant \u2014 they become your main tool for survival.<br>The world bends to your actions: rotate space, change the direction of falling, control objects, and discover new paths where there were once only walls or void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each challenge demands something different \u2014 reflexes, focus, strategy, or pure creativity. There is no single \u201cright\u201d solution: every level is an experiment with physics, where a mistake turns into chaos, and a clever move gives you complete control over gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique puzzles with shifting gravity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tests of speed, reaction, and attention.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic arcade elements where quick thinking is key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric, ever-changing worlds where even physics itself is against you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity</strong> is a challenge to both your imagination and your reflexes. Can you master the force that rules the universe?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Complete level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3916050/e1a5f19934b0fd4995a5e002e9d169d7b1f06443.jpg"},{"name":"Complete level 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3916050/c28b2f0a18a996ce9fe7a7ad3665f30b8c5afaf4.jpg"},{"name":"Complete level 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3916050/868e01572b76bcbe75833793c27d345e6cf4bdda.jpg"},{"name":"Complete level 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3916050/ac202bb7bb6ea5f617fe6dc27cecdcb5657deb05.jpg"},{"name":"Complete level 5","path":"https://cdn.akam